that you have in Cloud Code.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:44.920
It's called
continuous deployment.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.490
When I do continuously
deploy, what it's going to do,

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.990
it's going to deploy
my application.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.740
But each time I change
something like config file

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.910
or the sources, it's
going to rebuild what

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.210
needs to be rebuilt.
It's going to redeploy

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.570
what needs to be redeployed.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.430
I just need to focus on my code.

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.900
That's it.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.220
No more deploying.

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:06.260
It's going to be
done automatically.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.550
So I can just fix my issue.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.050
OK, MongoDB, username.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.240
It needs environment variable.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:16.900
So I'm going to
configure it here.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.860
I'm going to add
environment variable.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:22.790
It needs a name.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.270
I'm going to use the
value from the secret.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:27.850
So it's going to be a secret.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:32.140
And Cloud Code, we even
