I didn't copy-paste anything.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.790
I did not run any
chain of commands.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:56.340
It's deployed on my cluster.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.840
That's nice, right?

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:59.520
So I can use it.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.110
I can use my app.

