it's not running locally

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:22.890
on my machine.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.380
It's running on a cluster
somewhere on a pod.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.860
It's quite complicated.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.560
But with Cloud Code, it
doesn't have to be complicated.

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.130
I'm going to switch
to the Debug tab.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.950
I'm going to debug the back end.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:38.220
And it's going to connect
to my application.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.740
It's running on the
pod, on a container,

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.820
but it doesn't matter.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:43.160
It can connect to it.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:47.760
It can debug it from VS Code
